# Benchmark output. Two roots, because ADR-0027 gave the converted artifact a life longer
# than the run that wrote it: `results/` gains one small run directory per run, `artifacts/`
# holds the converted copies and is the large one. Both are machine-specific, and a result is
# published by hand rather than committed.
results/
artifacts/

